:: OC Bobbay Say Hello Barn Feed Chickens [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 10>>
You see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> in the chicken coop, scattering feed and checking on the little cluckers. You call out to him and walk over to the fence, causing the chickens eating over there to scatter as you approach. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey there!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> says with a smile. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What are you doing over here? Looking for work?”</span> You shrug, saying that you were just in the area and thought you’d say hello. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, yeah? I’m sure you come all the way out here often.”</span> You both laugh.<br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Smile",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "OC Bobby",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Everyday",
            Mouth: "Smile",
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: lightgreen">You spend the next few minutes chatting with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> and watching him work.</span> You also try to interact with some of the chickens that come near the fence, but whenever you hold your hand out to them, they panic and run off. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> chuckles at this and admits that the girls get a bit skittish this time of year. <br>
<<socialChange "Bobby" 1 1>>
<<needChange "Fun" 6>>
<br>
[[Continue|OC Bobby Farm Local]]

:: OC Bobbay Say Hello Barn Cleaning the Barn [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 10>>
You spot <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> near the entrance to the barn. He is lugging a large burlap sack that he plops down heavily before grabbing a shovel. He then begins to shovel… <span style="Color: yellow">well, let’s just say you find it weird that farms collect this sort of thing for fertilizer and you keep yourself down wind.</span> You call out to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> and say hello, asking him how he’s doing. <br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Smile",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "OC Bobby",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Everyday",
            Mouth: "SmirK",
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Doing great! Living the dream!”</span> He laughs, holding up a shovel full of the stuff. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You should come join me. Plenty of the dream to go around!”</span> You laugh and politely refuse his ‘generous’ offer. Though you do decide to keep him company and chat for a while. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> talks about all the different things he has to do around the farm. You quickly learn that shoveling this stuff is one of the easier jobs. <span style="Color: lightgreen">You have no idea how he does it.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Bobby" 1 1>>
<<needChange "Fun" 6>>
<br>
[[Continue|OC Bobby Farm Local]]

:: OC Bobby Say Hello Barn Horse Care [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 10>>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> is currently in the barn next to one of the horse stables. He is brushing the mane of one of the horses as he talks to it. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah? Does that feel good, girl? You’ll look great by the time I’m done!”</span> You scare him slightly by asking why he’s talking to the horse. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>? When did you get here?”</span> He puts the brush down for a second, but the horse loudly neighs at him. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alright, alright. Calm down.”</span> He laughs, picking the brush back up and continuing. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“She can be so needy sometimes.”</span> <br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Smile",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "OC Bobby",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Everyday",
            Mouth: "Smile",
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

You walk up to the horse cautiously; it’s large size a bit intimidating. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“She’s a bit of a diva. Likes her hair brushed and gets upset if I don’t give it the attention she thinks it deserves. I’d offer you a try, but she gets pretty jealous.”</span> You are a bit confused about how a horse can be jealous, <span style="Color: yellow">but as you see its eyes glaring at you, you figure it is probably for the best.</span> <span style="Color: lightgreen">You spend the next few minutes chatting with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> about his horse and all the rides he’s taken for the next few minutes as he finishes up.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Bobby" 1 1>>
<<needChange "Fun" 6>>
<br>
[[Continue|OC Bobby Farm Local]]

:: OC Bobby Say Hello Fields Picking Oranges [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 10>>
You spy <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> on a ladder climbing up one of the orange trees. He is picking oranges from the tree and dropping them into the basket below. You notice one misses the basket and run over to grab it before it rolls away. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> spots you and laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Thanks! Guess it is getting kind of full.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> climbs down as you place the orange in the basket. <br>
<<if ["Warm", "Hot", "Temperate"].includes($Temp) && $Player.Kinks.Teens == 1>>
    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Tired",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Bobby",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Smile",
            },
            Clothes: {
                Top: $None,
                Over: $None,
                Outer: $None,
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

    <span style="Color: pink">You can’t help but blush as you watch him. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> is without a shirt and sweating in the hot sunlight. His skin glistens with sweat on his muscled frame. You have to bite your lower lip as he stretches his arms into the air, causing his muscles to flex. All this farm work really does wonders for his body!</span> <br>
    <<set _arousalbs to []>>
    <<set _arousalkink to ["Teens"]>>
    <<arousalGain 10 _arousalbs _arousalkink>>
    <br>
<<else>>
    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Smile",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Bobby",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Smile",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>
<</if>>
He thanks you with a head pat before picking up the basket and beginning to carry it off. You follow, asking him how he’s doing. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Just working. Want to get most of these before they fall off by themselves, make them shelf-stable for as long as possible. Then again, people really love oranges in this town, so they fly off the shelves.”</span> He laughs, placing the basket down next to about a dozen other full ones. He then grabs another one and continues on as you follow behind for a bit chatting. <br>
<<socialChange "Bobby" 1 1>>
<<needChange "Fun" 6>>
<br>
