<<set $Minutes += 10>>
<<if $OCBobbyDog != 1>>
    You spot <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> is one of the large fields holding what appears to be a ball. He throws it and you are confused until you spot the yellow blur race after it and leap into the sky, catching it expertly! His dog had blended in with the tall grass. <span style="Color: yellow">The pup races back to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> until it gets a scent of something else… you!</span> <br>
    <br>
    <<if $FearDogs == 1>>
        <span style="Color: lightcoral">Like a bullet, the dog turns in your direction and sprints at full speed towards you! You don’t even have time to scream before –</span> <span style="Color: Red">WHAM</span> <span style="Color: lightcoral">– the dog jumps onto you.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jasper</span>?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> says in confusion before he hears you scream and rushes over. <span style="Color: lightcoral">The beast is licking and jumping all over you, causing your heart to race as you try to shove it off. Once you finally get to your feet and try to escape, you feel its vicious teeth sink into the leg of your bottoms. But you don’t care, you let it be ripped off as you are so desperate to escape.</span> <br>

