            <br>
        <</if>>
        He finds you a few minutes later, hunched behind some boxes using an empty burlap sack to cover yourself. He tosses you your, slight slobbered on, bottoms and asks if you are alright. <span style="Color: lightcoral">You nod, turning around to fix your clothing, as you admit to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> that you are afraid of dogs.</span> <br>
        <br>
