        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry about <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jasper</span>, he gets a little excited.”</span> He laughs, petting the dog as you all sit down to catch your breath, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He loves kids and wouldn’t hurt a fly, but he will go for the face.”</span> You’ve realized, as you try to wipe all the slobber off your face. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You kind of deserved it, sneaking up on us like that.”</span> <span style="Color: lightgreen">You hang out with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> for a bit, playing with his dog until he has to get back to work.</span> <br>
